            source: "opensa spiders_heavy: Range 18c0, ReloadDelay 40, Damage 3000, Spread 256; Missile launched at up to 100, accelerating 12 per tick to 350, turning 20 per tick (OpenRA default), RangeLimit 40c0, smoke trail, MISSILELAUNCH; ORIGINAL VALUES: original: WeaponMissile FUN_00433b60 damage 60; Missile Spider FUN_0040f450 range 18; ORIGINAL RATE (2026-10-14): attack animation 100+100 ms, then 500-1999 ms (rand%1500+500)",
